# Media lives on the team Drive, never in git (workspace rule 3), at the
# mirrored path: Shared Assets/image-lane/runs/. That is the single
# home for every picture this lane makes — full-res output, sources, all of it.
#
# The web-copy exception was tried on 2026-08-26 and reversed the same day
# (Damon: "remove the image copies on github"). Two homes for one image is
# worse than one home anyone can reach — the Drive copy is the full-res
# original, not a downscale, and nobody has to guess which is current.
#
# Pictures only. The stage text in out/, the manifests and the specs stay in
# git: they are the refine material, and a prompt change is only judgeable
# against what the last one produced.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.mp4
*.mov
runs/*/assets/*.gemini-uri.json
runs/*/finals/.compose-tmp/

__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.swipe-cache/
